* WHAT IS?
----------

A Clock for countdown to the year 2000 util.




* HOW TO INSTALL
-----------------

1) Copy HowLong2000 into Zeus:Scripts/Main/


2) Put this into any Zeus Menu

   CMD_I:
	 SetStatus '"HowLong2000..."'
         ClrScr FORCE
         CallScript 'Main/HowLong2000'
         WaitReturn
  	 Signal MenuLoop





